      "writtenOn": "2024-10-07T18:39:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Optional:\n\nUnsure if we want to mention, but true will also be returned for devices where Safe Browsing is supported _but turned off_ in the settings (or otherwise unavailable).\n\n```\nThe {@code callback} will be invoked immediately with a value indicating whether \nSafe Browsing is supported by the device. However, this does not strictly\nguarantee that Safe Browsing will be available.\n```",
